    "report": "C",
    "text": "Actual: Strict rustdoc fails on two incorrect example links, unresolved `ptr::eq`, and a bare URL. The advisory pass also found 23 undocumented public items under `src/`, including both `and_try_compute_if_nobody_else` methods; 20 functions lack formal `Errors` sections, although many explain failures in prose.\n\n"
  },
  {
    "id": "P0096",
    "report": "C",
    "text": "Caller impact: Broken references and incomplete contracts hinder API use, particularly concurrent compute methods.\n\n"
